gate: OPEN
sprint: S89
title: Client bugs — events, track arrows, history day start, cluster, push
priority: P1
dep: S88

description: |
  Client list 2026-10-05. Code target: navitrack/navitrack-mobile-apps.
  All code commits for this sprint go to branch bug-fix-oct-2026.
  Do not commit sprint work to main.

  Web Cloud is out of this repo. CAN (ВН 0394 МР Краснощек) is T8 only
  when vehicleDatas already contains CAN keys in the mobile popup.
  Anything the app cannot fix is written by T10 after verification.

  Keep S87: History still selects the last segment. T4 only makes the first
  segment clock read 00:00 of the selected day.
  Keep S73: clustering stays on for the fleet. T5 ungroups only coincident
  markers at maximum zoom.

ground_truth:
  - src/screens/object-details/components/EventsTab.tsx
  - src/screens/object-details/lib/vehicle-event-config-ui.ts
  - src/screens/object-details/hooks/useObjectDetailsHistory.ts
  - src/store/useNotificationStore.ts
  - src/features/map/components/PolylineDecorator.tsx
  - src/screens/object-details/hooks/useHistoryTimeline.ts
  - src/features/map/components/cluster-map/ClusterMapVehicleLayer.tsx
  - src/features/notifications/lib/tauri-push-adapter.ts
  - src/shell/hooks/useMobileShell.ts
  - src/features/map/lib/popup-rows/build-vehicle-popup-rows.tsx

success_metrics:
  - Speeding km/h and stop seconds are editable and survive savevea + reload.
  - Visible track shows direction arrows after zoom and after pan.
  - First history row of a date is 00:00; last segment stays selected.
  - Coincident vehicles separate at max zoom; other zooms still cluster.
  - Speeding push is four lines in the app language (ru/uk/en).
  - Push tap opens the map popup on that event.
  - Mobile popup shows CAN rows present in vehicleDatas, or T8 stops with a report.
  - Every code commit is on bug-fix-oct-2026.
  - T10 lists backend and non-mobile follow-ups that this repo cannot close.

risks:
  - savevea may ignore a body that drops server fields.
  - System-notification click is not the push-notification arrival event.
  - Named vehicle may have no CAN keys in the mobile API.

invariants: sprints/73/S73-INVARIANTS.md
requires: [FRONTEND_DEV, MOBILE_TAURI]
estimated: 3–4 days

